<title>SWITZERLAND: Berner expects 20 mln Sfr profit in 1997.</title>
<headline>Berner expects 20 mln Sfr profit in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Franz Manser, chief executive of Berner insurance group, said he expected the Swiss-based company to make a profit of 20 million Swiss francs in 1997.</p>
<p>In 1996 it produced a loss of 26.6 million.</p>
<p>Manser was speaking at Berner's annual news briefing to present its 1996 results.</p>
<p>Berner is majority-owned by German insurer Allianz Holding AG.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
